      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " told Moses ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to say to the people of Israel, “Any of you or any foreigner living among you who gives any of his or her children to be used in the worship of the god Molech shall be stoned to death by the whole community. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If anyone gives one of his children to Molech and makes my sacred Tent unclean and disgraces my holy name, I will turn against him and will no longer consider him one of my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if the community ignores what he has done and does not put him to death, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I myself will turn against the man and his whole family and against all who join him in being unfaithful to me and worshipping Molech. I will no longer consider them my people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If anyone goes for advice to people who consult the spirits of the dead, I will turn against him and will no longer consider him one of my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep yourselves holy, because I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obey my laws, because I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and I make you holy.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
