        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.12+LEV.18.13+LEV.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 18.12–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a man has intercourse with his aunt, both of them must suffer the consequences for incest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a man has intercourse with his uncle's wife, he disgraces his uncle, and he and the woman will pay the penalty; neither of them will have children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 18.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a man marries his brother's wife, they will die childless. He has done a ritually unclean thing and has disgraced his brother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “Keep all my laws and commands, so that you will not be rejected by the land of Canaan, into which I am bringing you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not adopt the customs of people who live there; I am driving out those pagans so that you can enter the land. They have disgusted me with all their evil practices. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I have promised you this rich and fertile land as your possession, and I will give it to you. I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, and I have set you apart from the other nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, you must make a clear distinction between animals and birds that are ritually clean and those that are not. Do not eat unclean animals or birds. I have declared them unclean, and eating them would make you unclean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall be holy and belong only to me, because I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and I am holy. I have set you apart from the other nations so that you would belong to me alone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Any man or woman who consults the spirits of the dead shall be stoned to death; any person who does this is responsible for his own death.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
